                  对比不同 Group 构造、优势估计与分步奖励设计对工具策略、推理稳定性和最终判责的影响。
                </p>
              </section>
            </div>
            <div class="inline-tags" aria-label="实习技术关键词">
              <span>Post-training</span><span>Critic + Rethink</span><span>Agentic RL</span><span>Multi-Agent</span><span>Evaluation Harness</span>
            </div>
          </div>
